@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` awaits the runtime-provided canonical instruction loader with `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` and uses the returned content as the agent instruction. The custom runtime must supply that loader and preserve the returned `classify-for-human-review` action and `canApproveRefunds: false` constraint.
